          "userId": "eid_fd8cecea",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-12T12:21:00",
          "text": "I agree with Alice. Performance testing is crucial. Additionally, in the Customization and User Experience section, it might be beneficial to include more details on the types of customization available. For instance, can users create their own AI rules, or is it limited to predefined options? This could impact user engagement significantly.",
