          "timestamp": "2026-07-25T05:21:00",
          "text": "Thanks, Ian! I've gone through the document. One thing that stands out is the use of Apache Kafka for asynchronous communication. While it's robust, have we considered the overhead it might introduce? Maybe we could evaluate if a lighter alternative like RabbitMQ could suffice for our needs. Thoughts? 🤔",
