          "userId": "eid_6c9bbe3a",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-23T13:12:00",
          "text": "Great point, Ian! Also, in the 'UX Researcher' role, I'd suggest adding more details about how user feedback will be incorporated into the adaptive learning capabilities. This could strengthen our position on user-centric design.",
