          "userId": "eid_a9002ae2",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-23T13:17:00",
          "text": "From a QA perspective, it would be beneficial to include a section on testing strategies, particularly around data privacy compliance. This could reassure stakeholders about our commitment to security.",
